// `@storage` with a value outside the `StorageKind` domain.
//
// The domain is closed and owned by `engine-ecs-internals.md` §2
// (*Table vs SparseSet*): `table | sparse`, default `table`. `archetype`
// names the storage MODEL, not a mode of the domain, and is the kind of
// near-miss that passed silently before M1.B/G1 — every value did.
//
// Written in the ACCEPTED spelling on purpose. With the bare `archetype`
// this file would exercise the sigil rule and not the domain, and its own
// name would be a lie; `E0503_storage_bare_value.etch` is the fixture that
// owns the spelling.
//
// Expected: E0503 AnnotationArgMismatch (§13.3 step 3 — value).

@storage(.archetype)
component Burning {
    remaining: float = 3.0
}
